        "original_id": "0f40a126-0eed-5bb4-982c-a777f7922e41",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Wincenty Gostkowski, Antoni Patek, Adrien Philippe\n- Companies: Patek Philippe & Co.\n- Places: Geneva, Switzerland\n- Topics: watchmaking\n\nFacts:\n- Wincenty Gostkowski was born on March 29, 1807, and died on August 29, 1884.\n- Antoni Patek was born on June 14, 1812, and died on March 1, 1877.\n- Wincenty Gostkowski was a lawyer and an associate of Antoni Patek and Adrien Philippe in Patek Philippe & Co. in Geneva, Switzerland.\n- Antoni Patek, also known in French as Antoine Norbert de Patek, was a Polish pioneer in watchmaking.\n- Antoni Patek was a creator of Patek Philippe & Co., which was described as one of the most famous watchmaker companies.",
